# Build output for the sample-app fixture — never committed (T9, E1.8 plan §2).
# The .xcodeproj + Sources + Info.plist ARE committed; the derived .app is NOT.
# Root .gitignore carries the authoritative entries; this file is a local guard.

# xcodebuild derived data
DerivedData/

# Build output dir
build/

# Built .app bundles
*.app

# Xcode user state (per-developer, not shared)
*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
